---
alwaysApply: true
---

This project uses next-intl to handle translations.
You should NEVER hard-code text of any kind.
You are encouraged to created nested structures to organize translations, but you shouldn't use namespaces when calling
useTranslations():

- WRONG: const t = useTranslations("home"); t("a.b.c");
- WRONG: const t = useTranslations(); t("home.a.b.c);
